  "label": "The viewer is mapped onto Patrick Stewart as the recipient of scolding advice",
  "description": "The text 'if you're gonna screenshot a meme' implicitly refers to the viewer as the person performing the action. This textual entity is analogically mapped onto Patrick Stewart, who visually embodies the role of the scolding authority figure. His stern expression, direct gaze, and pointing gesture create a visual representation of someone scolding the viewer, thus establishing the mapping between the textual 'you' (the viewer) and the visual entity Patrick_Stewart.",
